Update 1.1.0:
    Feat:
        - Add 2 new classes : The Witch and the Guardian
        - Handle Advancements up to level 20
        - Implements cards up to level 7
        - Refactor form to implements cards
        - New type of cards: Base Cards
        - Handle visual and sound effect with Sequencer, J2BA and DAE
        - Handle special attributes for Witch : Skeleton sacrifice
        - Shortcuts to use first equipped weapons and sacrifice skeleton
        - Handle first special targeting: skeleton
        - Restrict HUD for players
        - Show max number and level of cards
        - Distinct deux type of deck: FQ Library and FQ Deck
        - FQ Library can't be populated by cards from other source
        - FQ Deck can be populated with Library's cards as long as the 'max number' is not exceeded
        - Cards moving from FQ Library to FQ Deck creat a new card instead
        - Restrict rights in deck for players
        - Macro to automate the creation of a FQ Deck and a FQ Library (deck replaced and generated up to level 5, single-classed)
        - Handle different behavior out of combat (currentDrop, draw and pick cards)
    Chore:
    - Migration v13
        - Remove deprecated methods
        - Migration cards flags to FQ typed system object
    - Unit testing
    - Add test world

